cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the VT Radar knowledge base, please cite it as below."
title: "RDA-ALAF: Agentic Landscape Assessment Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Buendia
    given-names: Patricia
    affiliation: Medgalia
repository-code: "https://github.com/MEDGALIA/ALAF"
abstract: >-
  RDA-ALAF (Agentic Landscape Assessment Framework) is an open-source
  framework for guiding agentic approaches to research data analysis and
  data sharing using structured knowledge and current-event intelligence.
  It uses GitOps and agentic workflows to help maintain and update its
  knowledge base, with human experts validating agent-proposed changes.
keywords:
  - research data
  - agentic AI
  - knowledge base
  - GitOps
  - RDA
license: BSD-3-Clause
